<title>USA: Citizens Utilities Q3 shr up at $0.20.</title>
<headline>Citizens Utilities Q3 shr up at $0.20.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citizens Utilities Company and Subsidiaries</p>
<p>			  Summary of Financial Results</p>
<p>	  for the Three Months and Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>		    September 30, 1996 and 1995</p>
<p>			     (Unaudited)</p>
<p>		(000 omitted except for per-share amounts)</p>
<p>				 3 Months Ended	 9 Months Ended</p>
<p>				    Sept. 30		 Sept. 30</p>
<p>				  1996	1995	  1996     1995</p>
<p> Revenues		  $319,959 $259,732    $967,224 $778,444</p>
<p>Expenses:</p>
<p>  Operating expenses    199,491  147,155     607,454  467,337</p>
